The distributed installer additionally bundles mpv (GPLv2+) and FFmpeg
(GPLv3, built with --enable-gpl --enable-version3) as separate executables
invoked via IPC / child processes (mere aggregation). Those bundled binaries
remain under their respective GPL licenses; the GPL component portion of the
installer is distributed under GPLv3. See THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for the
